        "trinity-episcopal:placement.stats[1].caption"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Pandan tout Middle School — konnen lekòl yo",
      "of": "ca583a86",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[0].when"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Ekspozisyon",
      "of": "504443a0",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[0].kind",
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[2].kind"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Konseye a ki responsab plasman nan lekòl piblik ak lekòl endepandan vizite lekòl nan zòn nan epi, nan pwòp mo li, li pran “a feel for who might benefit from knowing this school,” apre sa li oryante fanmi yo vè lekòl ki kadre ak sa yo vle: “Do they want big class sizes? Are sports important? Extracurricular?”",
      "of": "e135fec4",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[0].text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Middle School — wout entènay la, si yon fanmi vle l",
      "of": "eed87b96",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[1].when"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Yon wout apa",
      "of": "f2125a71",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[1].kind"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Plasman nan lekòl entènay jere apa e pa yon lòt moun. Se pa yon wout maji isit la: 12% nan tout gradye depi 2004 te ale nan lekòl entènay, e lis destinasyon an gen ladan l Deerfield, Lawrenceville, Mercersburg, Woodberry Forest, St. Paul’s ak The Taft School.",
      "of": "05e13053",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[1].text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "8yèm ane — desizyon an",
      "of": "ef786a6f",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[2].when"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Tèz K–8 la",
      "of": "9c3a944a",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[2].kind"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Agiman lekòl la deklare se ke nèf ane kote menm kò pwofesè a konnen yon timoun bay yon chwa pi byen enfòme: paran yo “feel more confident about finding the high school that’s best suited for their child at the end of 8th Grade rather than at the beginning of Kindergarten.”",
      "of": "70182269",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[2].text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Katrevendisenk high school ki site pa non atravè 23 pwomosyon — e dis nan yo gen pwòp dosye pa yo isit la.",
      "of": "99d8d661",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:destinations.headline"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Sa a se pwòp lis kimilatif lekòl la pou Pwomosyon 2004–2026 yo, gwoupe dapre sa chak destinasyon ye reyèlman. Se yon lis non sèlman: lekòl la pa pibliye okenn konte pa lekòl ni okenn atribisyon pa ane, donk okenn destinasyon pa dwe li kòm “N elèv te ale la”.",
      "of": "b9c27468",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:destinations.subhead"
