        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[0].kind"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "\"Each spring, rising 8th-grade parents attend a Parent Coffee to learn about the admissions process, events, deadlines, and other tips and information to prepare for the year ahead.\"",
      "of": "ad41cc41",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[0].text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "7yèm ane — yon ISEE pratik",
      "of": "b517bb3b",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[1].when"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Tès",
      "of": "0535d93b",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[1].kind"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Elèv yo pase Independent School Entrance Exam pou pratike nan 7yèm ane, apre sa pou plasman high school nan 8yèm, epi lekòl la bay preparasyon pou tès ISEE ant de yo: \"Students learn test-taking strategies and prepare for admissions testing to gain comfort and fine tune skills.\"",
      "of": "d11f63fe",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[1].text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Septanm 8yèm ane — High School Fair la",
      "of": "15a25aa9",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[2].when"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "\"In September, administrators from over 40 schools are invited to Charlotte Prep's High School Fair and Boarding School Fair to recruit our students.\" Fwa boarding la gen ladan l yon panèl diskisyon — yon fanmi 2026 di se li ki fè yo deside chwazi lekòl entènay.",
      "of": "051f6498",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[2].text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Otòn 8yèm ane — reyinyon ak vizit lekòl",
      "of": "e1f51311",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[3].when"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Konpatibilite",
      "of": "116f13cc",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[3].kind"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Ekip la rankontre chak elèv 8yèm ane youn pa youn epi apa ak paran chak elèv \"to discuss their plans, their objectives for their child, and appropriate placement opportunities.\" Yo ankouraje fanmi yo vizite jounen pòt ouvè ak vizit gide, epi elèv yo fè vizit yon jounen nan lekòl ki sou lis yo.",
      "of": "564e359c",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[3].text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "8yèm ane — entèvyou",
      "of": "b468c620",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[4].when"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Preparasyon",
      "of": "04b7937a",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[4].kind"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "\"In Leadership class, students learn interview etiquette and conduct. They learn about proper dress, eye contact, handshake, and what to look for as they seek the school that fits them best.\" Pwofesè ak administratè yo fè entèvyou simile, epi bwochi a ajoute yon entèvyou pratik ak direktè lekòl la.",
      "of": "8443e3d1",
      "at": [
        "charlotte-prep:placement.steps[4].text"
      ]
    },
